Project 5: Ask Your Notes: AI Document Q&A (Capstone)

What it is. An app where a user uploads PDFs, for example their semester notes or a company policy
document, and asks questions in plain language. The app finds the most relevant parts of the documents
and uses a large language model to answer, showing which page each answer came from.
Why it impresses. This is the kind of AI feature companies are actually building in 2026. It proves you
understand more than prompting: chunking text, embeddings, vector search, retrieval, cost and failure
cases. Combined with your backend projects, it makes your profile stand out strongly.

