Must have features
• Upload one or more PDFs, extract text, split it into chunks with page numbers.
• Create embeddings for each chunk and store them in the vector database.
• For each question, retrieve the top matching chunks and send them with the question to the LLM.
• Show the answer with sources (document name and page number).
• If the answer is not in the documents, the app must clearly say so instead of making something up.
• Save chat history per user.
Extra features once the basics work
• A small evaluation set: twenty questions with known answers, and a score for how many your app
gets right.
• Track response time and approximate cost per question.
• Streaming responses so the answer appears word by word.
• Support for Word files and web pages.
